{"id":"621336","name":"酱牛肉","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/621336/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛腱子","amount":"2块"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"块牛腱子切成四个小块，泡水2个小时，泡去血水。","img":"images/621336/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入葱姜蒜。","img":"images/621336/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入酱油。","img":"images/621336/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入豆瓣酱。","img":"images/621336/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"勺豆瓣酱，就是东北的大酱。","img":"images/621336/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"戴手套把酱料抓均匀，再使劲揉搓牛肉。","img":"images/621336/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盖上保鲜袋，腌制半天。","img":"images/621336/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中一勺清水，一勺白糖，炒个糖色。","img":"images/621336/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"小火熬至深褐色。","img":"images/621336/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入温水。","img":"images/621336/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"糖色熬好。","img":"images/621336/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"牛肉腌制半天以后。","img":"images/621336/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入高压锅，将腌制的汁也倒入，再加一点水。","img":"images/621336/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"准备香料。","img":"images/621336/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"再切葱姜。","img":"images/621336/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"锅中烧油少许。","img":"images/621336/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放入葱姜。","img":"images/621336/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"放入香料。","img":"images/621336/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"小火煸炒。","img":"images/621336/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"倒入酱油。","img":"images/621336/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"倒入糖色。","img":"images/621336/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"将料汁倒入高压锅。","img":"images/621336/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"再倒入糖色，没过牛肉。","img":"images/621336/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"高压锅压25分钟，家中有老人，牙口不好，时间久了一点。","img":"images/621336/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"放凉后用保鲜膜包住牛肉。","img":"images/621336/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"吃的时候切片。","img":"images/621336/step_26.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}